# PN Jewellers — Implementation Plan

## Overview

Build a luxury jewelry eCommerce platform inspired by Bluestone and Malabar Gold. The project consists of a **React (Vite) frontend** and a **Laravel 11 REST API backend**, connected to MySQL. The frontend uses Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, React Three Fiber, and Zustand for state management.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a large project. We will build **Phase 1–3 (frontend-first)** to get a working, visually stunning frontend with mock data, then layer in the Laravel backend in Phase 5. This lets us iterate on the UX rapidly.

