## Phase 1: Project Setup & Design System

### Frontend Scaffold

#### [NEW] `frontend/` — Vite + React + Tailwind project

Scaffolded via `npx -y create-vite@latest ./ --template react`. Then install:

- `tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite` (v4)
- `framer-motion`
- `@react-three/fiber @react-three/drei three`
- `zustand`
- `react-router-dom`
- `react-icons`

#### Folder structure

```
frontend/
├── src/
│   ├── components/     # Reusable UI (Button, Card, Badge, Navbar, Footer)
│   ├── features/       # Feature modules (cart, auth, wishlist, checkout)
│   ├── pages/          # Route-level pages (Home, Listing, Product, Cart, Checkout, Account)
│   ├── hooks/          # Custom hooks (useScrollReveal, useParallax, use3DViewer)
│   ├── services/       # API service layer
│   ├── store/          # Zustand stores (cart, auth, ui)
│   ├── assets/         # Images, GLB models, HDR maps
│   ├── styles/         # Global CSS, design tokens
│   └── data/           # Mock product/category data (used until backend is ready)
```

