## Phase 5: Backend (Laravel 11)

### [NEW] `backend/` — Laravel 11 project

#### Database Schema (MySQL)

| Table | Key Columns |
|---|---|
| `users` | id, name, email, password, phone, address_json |
| `products` | id, name, slug, description, base_price, category_id, metal_type, stone_type, images_json, model_3d_url, is_featured |
| `categories` | id, name, slug, image_url |
| `cart_items` | id, user_id, product_id, quantity, metal_option, stone_option, size |
| `orders` | id, user_id, total, status, address_json, payment_id |
| `order_items` | id, order_id, product_id, quantity, price, options_json |
| `reviews` | id, user_id, product_id, rating, comment |
| `wishlists` | id, user_id, product_id |

#### REST API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/register` | User registration |
| POST | `/api/login` | User login (token) |
| GET | `/api/products` | List products (filterable) |
| GET | `/api/products/{slug}` | Product detail |
| GET | `/api/categories` | List categories |
| GET/POST/DELETE | `/api/cart` | Cart CRUD |
| POST | `/api/orders` | Place order |
| GET | `/api/orders` | User order history |
| GET/POST | `/api/reviews` | Reviews CRUD |
| GET/POST/DELETE | `/api/wishlist` | Wishlist CRUD |

